{"ref":"BDB, עֶ֫צֶב","hw":"עֶ֫צֶב","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֶ֫צֶב</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>pain, hurt, toil</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <em>pain</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:16\" href=\"/Genesis.3.16\">Gn 3:16</a> (of travail), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.22\">Pr 10:22</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>hurt</em> (of mind), <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבַר־ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.1\">Pr 15:1</a> <em>a word that hurts</em> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲנֶה־רַךְ</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>toil</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.23\">Pr 14:23</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם הָעֲצָבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 127:2\" href=\"/Psalms.127.2\">ψ 127:2</a> <em>bread of</em> (gained by) <em>toils;</em> sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲצָבֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.10\">Pr 5:10</a>.","next":"BDB, עֹ֫צֶב","prev":"BDB, עָצַב"}